{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to this fantastic summer camp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will spend the next 3 days doing various activities, exploring the area and above all, learning about various LGBTQ+ issues during your stay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the varied activities that the camp offers, such as a game of scavenger hunt, archery or the talks that take place every night around the campfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/Bow_1.gif?t=1740412839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore the different areas of the camp and take the opportunity to talk, interact and get to know your fellow campers better. How you respond in your interactions can influence the outcome of your experience.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/Walk_2.gif?t=1740412839\" />LGBTQ+ themes and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The camp will bring up a wide variety of LGBTQ+ issues related to sexuality, gender, phobias and more that will lead you to learn about them in order to better relate to the camp.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/extras/LGBTQ+_1.gif?t=1740412839\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450890?t=1740412839","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450890?t=1740412839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/a94b0bd0e3e7d8f21a04ef9c66ed033f57611a59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740412839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450890/a94b0bd0e3e7d8f21a04ef9c66ed033f57611a59